WEBVTT

00:01:28.524 --> 00:01:32.029
Gender and climate
are inextricably linked.

00:01:32.881 --> 00:01:37.012
Drawing down emissions
depends on rising up.

00:01:38.980 --> 00:01:40.572
First, a bit of context.

00:01:41.492 --> 00:01:45.919
We are in a situation of urgency,
severity and scope

00:01:45.943 --> 00:01:48.495
never before faced by humankind.

00:01:49.249 --> 00:01:54.416
So far, our response isn't
anywhere close to adequate.

00:01:55.762 --> 00:01:57.463
But you already know that.

00:01:58.155 --> 00:02:00.509
You know it in your gut,